---
import './design-aids.css';
import SketchSheet from './SketchSheet.astro';
---
<figure id="schema-map" class="design-aid design-figure paper-surface schema-map wide" aria-labelledby="schema-map-title">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration · Relationships</span>
  <h3 id="schema-map-title">Follow an order to its customer and products</h3>
  <p>C4 makes two orders. O12 contains two mugs; O13 contains another mug and a bowl. Each line belongs to one order and names one product.</p>
  <div class="schema-route">
    <div class="design-record customer-node">
      <SketchSheet tone="teal">
      <h4>customers</h4>
      <table><caption class="visually-hidden">One customer</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">customer_id</th><th scope="col">name</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code>C4</code></th><td>Ada</td></tr></tbody></table>
      </SketchSheet>
    </div>
    <div class="schema-link customer-edge"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 30" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M117 15 L3 15 M11 8 L3 15 L11 22" /></svg><p><strong>Many orders<br />one customer</strong><br /><code>customer_id</code></p></div>
    <div class="design-record order-node">
      <SketchSheet>
      <h4>orders</h4>
      <table><caption class="visually-hidden">Two orders both refer to customer C4</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">order_id</th><th scope="col">customer_id</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code>O12</code></th><td class="design-current"><code>C4</code></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>O13</code></th><td class="design-current"><code>C4</code></td></tr></tbody></table>
      </SketchSheet>
    </div>
    <div class="schema-link order-edge"><svg viewBox="0 0 30 90" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 87 L15 3 M8 11 L15 3 L22 11" /></svg><p><strong>Many lines → one order</strong><br /><code>order_id</code></p></div>
    <div class="design-record line-node">
      <SketchSheet>
      <h4>order_lines</h4>
      <table><caption class="visually-hidden">Three lines bridge orders and products</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">order_id</th><th scope="col">line_no</th><th scope="col">product_id</th><th scope="col">quantity</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code>O12</code></th><td><code>1</code></td><td class="design-current"><code>P7</code></td><td>2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>O13</code></th><td><code>1</code></td><td class="design-current"><code>P7</code></td><td>1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>O13</code></th><td><code>2</code></td><td><code>P8</code></td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table>
      </SketchSheet>
    </div>
    <div class="schema-link product-edge"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 30" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M117 15 L3 15 M11 8 L3 15 L11 22" /></svg><p><strong>Many lines<br />one product</strong><br /><code>product_id</code></p></div>
    <div class="design-record product-node">
      <SketchSheet tone="blue">
      <h4>products</h4>
      <table><caption class="visually-hidden">Two products</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">product_id</th><th scope="col">name</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row" class="design-current"><code>P7</code></th><td>Blue mug</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>P8</code></th><td>Bowl</td></tr></tbody></table>
      </SketchSheet>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>O13 names two products, and P7 appears in two orders: the lines record the many-to-many relationship. Line 1 can occur in both orders because <code>(O12, 1)</code> and <code>(O13, 1)</code> are different identities. Arrows follow references to the row they name. Dates and prices are omitted here.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .schema-map.wide { margin-left:50%; }
  .schema-map .design-record { border:0; padding:0; }
  .schema-route { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 8rem minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows:auto 7rem auto; max-width:54rem; margin:1.5rem auto 0; gap:0 .8rem; }
  .customer-node { grid-column:1; grid-row:1; }
  .order-node { grid-column:3; grid-row:1; }
  .line-node { grid-column:3; grid-row:3; }
  .product-node { grid-column:1; grid-row:3; }
  .customer-edge { grid-column:2; grid-row:1; }
  .order-edge { grid-column:3; grid-row:2; }
  .product-edge { grid-column:2; grid-row:3; }
  .schema-link { display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .schema-link p { font-size:.75rem; text-align:center; margin:.2rem 0; }
  .schema-link strong { color:var(--color-text); font-weight:600; }
  .schema-link svg { display:block; width:100%; height:30px; color:var(--teal); }
  .schema-link path { fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:1.2; stroke-linejoin:round; stroke-linecap:round; vector-effect:non-scaling-stroke; }
  .order-edge { flex-direction:row; align-items:center; gap:.7rem; }
  .order-edge svg { height:90px; width:30px; }
  .order-edge p { text-align:left; }
  @media(max-width:700px) {
    .schema-route { display:flex; flex-direction:column; max-width:35rem; gap:0; }
    .schema-link { flex-direction:row; align-items:center; justify-content:flex-start; gap:.8rem; min-height:6rem; }
    .schema-link svg { display:none; }
    .schema-link::before { content:'↑'; width:2rem; flex-shrink:0; text-align:center; font-size:2rem; color:var(--teal); }
    .schema-link p { text-align:left; }
    .product-edge::before { content:'↓'; }
    .schema-link strong br::after { content:' '; }
  }
  @media(max-width:420px) { table { font-size:.72rem; } thead th { overflow-wrap:anywhere; } }
</style>
